    "detailed_description": "An inspiring journey to the land of &quot;morning freshness&quot;! Collect fascinating puzzles, marvel at the beauty of snow-white beaches on the shores of the Pacific Ocean, see unique temples of South Korea and get acquainted with the national Korean cuisine.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game allows you to choose the desired level of difficulty, use hints, as well as save your progress and continue at any convenient time! Suitable for both beginners and experienced players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 500 high quality pictures<br />\r\n- an elaborate game mode with handy hints, sorting and a magnifying glass<br />\r\n- individual setting of each puzzle complexity, allowing you to play an infinite number of times<br />\r\n- Possibility to turn off the rotation mode of puzzle pieces<br />\r\n- function of saving and resuming the process of assembling a puzzle at any time<br />\r\n- Colorful trophies to consolidate your success",
